break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然写真の意味がわからない方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飾りの花が食べれるか真剣に悩んでるヨーコです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず自由な外仕事現場で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカは羽を伸ばしっぱなしでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0317_8_ijg9gsj90gsej90gsjg9esjges9jj9ges8.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影後に持ち帰ったたけのこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0317_9_fj9j9sjs9ejes9jfs9e0jf9es0jse.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フードさんにお願いして持ち帰ったイチゴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村にはナイショ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおととい発売のEX大衆のオフショットでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村が表紙、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨーコと富田は中面、インタビュー企画できらりんかほりんも登場してます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひごらんあれ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s. この前のTGCのオフショット、どこで出そうか迷い中〜"}],"source":"official"}}